# the sess script: keys for tsess - switching sessions
# Ctrl+] (character $1D, as from a terminal) in the computational loop of session 0
after "SPIN\n" steps 3000 key 1D 00
# Ctrl+[ (scancode [ with Ctrl) while session 1 waits in CON_GETEV
after "CHILD BACK\n" steps 3000 key 00 1A 2
# again in session 1: CON_GETEV is executed again and gets 'x'
after "TO CHILD\n" steps 60000 key 78 2D
# Ctrl+[ in the middle of SLEEP(1000) of session 1
after "SLEEP\n" steps 8000 key 00 1A 2
